    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project includes the development of the fourth methanol plant located at the Saudi Methanol Company (Ar-Razi) industrial complex in Jubail Industrial City, with an annual production capacity of 850,000 metric tons, increasing the complex&rsquo;s total annual output capacity to 3.1 million metric tons.</p>\r\n",
